 expeditions stopped, and the Astra Protocol was consigned to the history books. That was until you received a strange transmission:\n\n++++++++++++++++++++\n\nThe Astra Protocol was not an order.\n\nIt was a warning.\n\nWe were betrayed.\n\n++++++++++++++++++++\n\nWhat was this warning, why were they betrayed? A question needed to be answered. With no other options you signed a cruel and punishing contract with the Apex Corporation - the only way to get off-world and begin your investigation. Perhaps this is your chance to reveal the truth behind the Astra Protocol. All you needed to do was keep your new masters happy - and work out how to fly your ship.", "summary": "Cassette futuristic space simulator", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-astra-protocol", "videos": [{"id": 190104, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "qzbf9yZZ6m4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qzbf9yZZ6m4", "title": "The Astra Protocol Teaser #indiegame", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qzbf9yZZ6m4/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 6415, "name": "Astra Protocol"}]}